1.) Add an ACCEPT entry here.
    typedef packet_action{
        type enumeration {
            enum DROP;
            enum ACCEPT;   <<<<<<<<<<
            enum FORWARD;
            enum REDIRECT;
            enum DO_NOT_NAT;
        }
    }


2.)https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7951  To know JSON to yang encoding.

3.) Add the test case:

3a.) Add a json entry for test in acl.json file [https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/blob/master/src/sonic-yang-models/tests/yang_model_tests/tests_config/acl.json]

   "ACL_RULE_PACKET_ACTION_ACCEPT": {
        "sonic-acl:sonic-acl": {
            "sonic-acl:ACL_RULE": {
                "ACL_RULE_LIST": [
                    {
                        "ACL_TABLE_NAME": "NO-NSW-PACL-V6",
                        "DST_IPV6": "2001::2/64",
                        "PACKET_ACTION": "ACCEPT",   <<< We are just testing it.
                        "PRIORITY": 999980,
                        "RULE_NAME": "Rule_20"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "sonic-acl:ACL_TABLE": {
                "ACL_TABLE_LIST": [
                    {
                        "ACL_TABLE_NAME": "NO-NSW-PACL-V6",
                        "policy_desc": "Filter IPv6",
                        "ports": [
                            "Ethernet0",
                        ],
                        "stage": "EGRESS",
                        "type": "L3V6"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "sonic-port:sonic-port": {
            "sonic-port:PORT": {
                "PORT_LIST": [
                    {
                        "admin_status": "up",
                        "alias": "eth0",
                        "description": "Ethernet0",
                        "mtu": 9000,
                        "name": "Ethernet0",
                        "speed": 25000
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },

3b.)  in tests/acl.json file add below entry:

https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/blob/master/src/sonic-yang-models/tests/yang_model_tests/tests/acl.json

Since our case is validation success, we will add an entry as below:

 "ACL_RULE_PACKET_ACTION_ACCEPT": {
     "desc": 'PACKET_ACTION ACCEPT should be validated and marked as success by Libyang'
}

Test File: https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/blob/master/src/sonic-yang-models/tests/yang_model_tests/test_yang_model.py

4.) Build sonic_yang_models-1.0-py3-none-any.whl PKG.   Above are build time test cases.
